 | Fact | Source | A hand-entered value is… |
 |---|---|---|
-| `startedAt` | the maker harness log: the earliest call's response `created` (else its `Date` header) | a cross-check: refused if more than **60 s** off |
-| `producedAt` | the maker harness log: the last call's response `Date` header (else `created`) | a cross-check, 60 s |
+| `startedAt` | the maker harness log: the first call's `sent_at` (request-send time); the log and line are named in `x-plumbline.startedAt_source` | a cross-check: refused if more than **60 s** off |
+| `producedAt` | the maker harness log: the last call's `received_at` (reply-receive time); the log and line are named in `x-plumbline.producedAt_source` | a cross-check, 60 s |
